<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$115 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$115 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prommissory note tenders continued at a steady pace on the Australian commercial paper market with a further four held on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tenders totalled A$$115 million and the largest was for Airservices which came with a A$40 million transaction of December 3-dated paper, which fetched a yield of 6.47 to 6.48 percent.</p>
